Limited mining operations-water quality
HB0059
testing.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Harshman, Campbell, E and Larson,
JT and Senator(s) Anderson, Boner and Rothfuss
AN ACT relating to environmental quality; specifying that the department of
environmental quality may conduct water quality testing before the commencement
of limited mining operations; amending notice requirements for limited mining
operations; requiring rulemaking; and providing for an effective date.
